    externalId = retrieveExternalIDFromYkeykey(); // would return "hockey"
    AWSCredentialsProviderImpl awsCredProvider = new AWSCredentialsProviderImpl(ztsUrl,
        sslContext, "sherpa.property", "s3-uploader", null, null, externalId);
```

